TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 with equilibrium phases
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    units mol/kgw
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -totals Fe(+2) Fe(+3)
    -molalities Fe+2 Fe+3 FeOH+ Fe(OH)2+ Fe(OH)3 Fe(OH)4- FeSO4 FeCl+ FeCl2+ FeHCO3+ FeCO3 Fe(CO3)2-2 FeHSO4+ FeSO4+ FeSO4
END
